  "unresolved": [
    "2026-09-20: Official table reconfirms Z, 15 elements/13 groups, 10 blades, T2.9–16, 0.85 m, manual focus and 82 mm thread; explicit focus-ring rotation establishes ring function. Table gives cross-mount length 153.5–157.5 mm and mass 1365–1401 g without assigning Z, so these remain null. Shared series lateral images inspected, including 75 mm, but Z rear/opposite side/underside were not established. Existing contact absence, mechanical focus coupling and stabilization absence need stronger operating/Z-specific evidence. Product description lists RF/L/E while selector and specification table include Z. Directional maximum magnifications (vertical 1:10.15, horizontal 1:15.66) were not collapsed into an unqualified scalar."
